{"id": "EUVD-2026-97650", "enisaUuid": "2e2db71c-19b7-3dc8-a15a-f77a028b3b32", "description": "Gitoxide gix-mailmap before 0.35.0 contains a denial of service vulnerability that allows attackers to exhaust CPU through quadratic-time parsing in Snapshot::from_bytes. Attackers can commit a crafted .mailmap with descending-ordered entries forcing repeated front inserts, blocking workers running log, blame, or shortlog for minutes.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T16:05:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:16:02", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/GitoxideLabs/gitoxide/security/advisories/GHSA-pmpw-wwcm-r8rc", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitoxide-gix-mailmap-before-0.35.0-cpu-denial-of-service-via-mailmap-parsing"], "aliases": ["GHSA-mjrq-mxwp-ch57", "CVE-2026-109348"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2b105648-9028-39b9-80ff-c38ddb37af29", "product": {"name": "gix-mailmap", "vendor": {"name": "GitoxideLabs"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.35.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b9462905-51d3-3d54-84d5-520c427a4a85", "vendor": {"name": "GitoxideLabs"}}], "isExploited": false}